-      { h2: 'Value — $55/Dozen in Context', body: "Each ball costs $4.58. Losing 2 per round costs $9.16 in lost balls plus the one you finish with — roughly $14 per round. Over 25 rounds: $350 on Pro V1s.\n\nVice Pro alternative: same season at $33/dozen saves $144. Srixon Q-Star Tour at $35 saves $125. The question: is the Pro V1 spin and consistency gap worth $125-$144 per year? For golfers shooting 78-88 who hit 8-12 greens, probably yes. For golfers shooting 95+, the difference disappears in inconsistent ball striking." },
