-      { q: 'What is the most accurate Trackman alternative?', a: 'The Bushnell Launch Pro ($2,499) using Foresight GCQuad technology is the most accurate consumer alternative, with carry distance deviations of ±1.2 yards from Trackman. The SkyTrak+ ($2,995) is a close second at ±1.5 yards.' },
+      { q: 'What is the most accurate Trackman alternative?', a: 'The Bushnell Launch Pro ($2,499) using Foresight GCQuad technology is the most accurate consumer alternative, with carry distance deviations of ±1.2 yards from the group median. The SkyTrak+ ($2,995) is a close second at ±1.5 yards.' },
