       { h2: 'Features and Metrics Compared', body: '<p>The SkyTrak+ measures 18 parameters. The MLM2PRO measures 12. But both cover the metrics that matter for improvement:</p><table class="cmp-table"><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>MLM2PRO</th><th>SkyTrak+</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ball Speed</td><td>✅</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Carry Distance</td><td>✅</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Launch Angle</td><td>✅</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Spin Rate</td><td>✅ (sub)</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Spin Axis</td><td>✅ (sub)</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Smash Factor</td><td>✅</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Club Speed</td><td>❌</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Apex Height</td><td>❌</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Descent Angle</td><td>❌</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>Video Replay</td><td>✅</td><td>❌</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The MLM2PRO has one unique advantage: video replay with data overlay. You can watch your swing with ball data superimposed. The SkyTrak+ does not offer this.</p>', badge: 'STRONG PICK', rating: 4.5, affiliateKey: 'rapsodo-mlm2pro' },
